* Plain FFIX 2-block MSLD setup for the fixed-lambda-window FEP scan.
* Caller must set @ffixlam1, @ffixlam2, @temp first.
*
BLOCK 3
   clear
END

BLOCK 3
   Call 2 sele site1sub1 end
   Call 3 sele site1sub2 end

   qldm theta
   lang temp @temp

   ldin 1 1.0       0.0 5.0 0.0 5.0
   ldin 2 @ffixlam1 0.0 5.0 0.0 5.0
   ldin 3 @ffixlam2 0.0 5.0 0.0 5.0

   adex 2 3

   rmla bond thet impr
   msld 0 1 1 ffix
   msma

   soft w14
   pmel ex

   ldbi 0
END
